faqs:
  - q: "Does CoopCircle hold our money?"
    a: "No. Online payments go through Paystack, straight into your society’s bank account. Bank transfers go directly from the member’s bank to yours."
  - q: "What does it cost our society?"
    a: "Nothing more than your plan. Members pay a small fee when they pay online, and they see it before they pay. Bank transfers have no fee."
  - q: "What if a payment doesn’t show up?"
    a: "We check each online payment with Paystack and add it once. If it can’t be added, the member and your president are told, and the money is refunded. A bank transfer waits until a leader confirms it."
  - q: "Can members still pay at the branch?"
    a: "Yes. Paying in the app is an extra choice. Branch staff keep recording cash, transfer and POS payments as before."
